### Add Newsfeeds Category
# @name Add Newsfeeds Category
POST {{base_url}}/v1/newsfeeds/categories
X-Joomla-Token: {{api_key}}
Accept: application/vnd.api+json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Example"
}

### Get Newsfeeds Category
# @name Get Newsfeeds Category
GET {{base_url}}/v1/newsfeeds/categories/{{category_id}}
X-Joomla-Token: {{api_key}}
Accept: application/vnd.api+json

### Update Newsfeeds Category
